      "problem": "$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 3 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 6 & 4\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nConsider the matrix given above. Identify **all** of the reasons why one can conclude that $|A|=0?$\n\nI. $A$ has identical rows\n\nII. $A$ has proportional columns\n\nIII. $A$ has a zero row",
